WEBVTT

00:07:27.496 --> 00:07:31.371
I thought that, you know, I'm not an
expert. This is your field, not mine.

00:07:31.371 --> 00:07:38.204
But I thought that engagement has is
close to feeling good at work.

00:07:38.371 --> 00:07:43.621
I mean, we whether it's the responsibility
of workplaces to deal

00:07:43.621 --> 00:07:45.454
with people's well-being in general,

00:07:45.663 --> 00:07:47.788
I agree that it's they're responsible

00:07:47.788 --> 00:07:50.913
for dealing with people's
well-being at work.

00:07:51.079 --> 00:07:55.954
And that doesn't seem to me to be very
different from trying to make people

00:07:56.246 --> 00:07:59.204
engaged and happy with
what they are doing.

00:07:59.246 --> 00:08:04.538
So I'm a bit curious to hear
more about the dichotomy of